{"title":"Worldmap","sourceTitle":"Worldmap/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Worldmap\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Worldmap (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Mapa del mundo (42% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Carte du monde (42% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Mappa del mondo (84% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/sk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Mapa sveta (42% translated)\" lang=\"sk\" dir=\"ltr\">slovenčina</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Карта мира (42% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"世界地图 (84% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Worldmap/ja\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"ワールドマップ (21% translated)\" lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">日本語</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Map.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/1/16/Map.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"411\" height=\"431\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"411\" data-file-height=\"431\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>O mapa mundial ainda não oferece suporte a todos os recursos com os quais estaria acostumado em outras ferramentas de mapeamento do jogo. No entanto, ainda é muito útil\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Use a tecla <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F6</kbd> para alternar a versão do HUD - versão pequena do minimapa no canto superior direito da tela do jogador.</li>\n<li>Use a tecla <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">M</kbd> para alternar a versão grande - enquanto ativada, impede que os jogadores interajam com o mundo.</li>\n<li>Use a tecla <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Space</kbd> na versão grande para centralizar novamente a visualização do mapa no player.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Coordinates\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Coordenadas\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Coordenadas</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Pontos_de_referência\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pontos de referência</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Fazendo_backup\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fazendo backup</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Tutoriais_em_Vídeo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tutoriais em Vídeo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Coordenadas\">Coordenadas</span></h2>\n<p>Você pode ativar uma sobreposição que mostra sua posição atual (em relação ao centro do mundo; para mais informações, consulte <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/coordinates\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/coordinates\">coordenadas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coordinates\" title=\"Coordinates\"> </a></span>).\n</p><p>Esta opção está em Configurações -&gt; Interface -&gt; Mostrar sobreposição de coordenadas ou use a tecla <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">V</kbd> (padrão)\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"Waypoints\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Pontos_de_refer.C3.AAncia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pontos_de_referência\">Pontos de referência</span></h2>\n<p>Use <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> no mapa grande (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">M</kbd>), digite o nome do waypoint e escolha um ícone. \n</p><p>Esses <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/List_of_server_commands#/waypoint\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/List of server commands\">comando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/List_of_server_commands#/waypoint\" title=\"List of server commands\"> </a></span>s adicionam, listam ou editam os waypoints dos jogadores:\n</p>\n<ul><li><code>/waypoint list</code> Mostra uma lista de todos os waypoints do jogador</li>\n<li><code>/waypoint remove [num]</code> Remove um número de waypoint conforme mostrado em /waypoint list</li>\n<li><code>/waypoint add</code> Pode ser combinado com diferentes informações, dependendo de como você deseja adicionar seu waypoint.\n<ul><li><code>/waypoint add [color] [title]</code><br />Adiciona um waypoint com determinada cor e texto em sua posição atual.</li>\n<li><code>/waypoint addat [coords] [fixado] [cor] [título]</code><br />Adicione um waypoint no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/coordinates\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/coordinates\">coordenadas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Coordinates\" title=\"Coordinates\"> </a></span> fornecido.</li>\n<li><code>/waypoint addati [icon] ~0 ~0 ~0 [fixado] [cor] [título]</code><br />Adicione um waypoint em sua localização atual, incluindo cor e informações do <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/VTML\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/VTML\">ícone</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/VTML\" title=\"VTML\"> </a></span>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>For example, <code>/waypoint addati tree ~ ~ ~ false white Resin</code> will create a waypoint at the player's current location named Resin with a white tree icon.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>A cor pode ser qualquer chamada <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.99colors.net/dot-net-colors.NET\">Color ou um código hexadecimal</a>.<br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 300px; text-align:center;\">\n<caption><b>Waypoint Icons</b>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Symbol</th>\n<th>Label\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>●</td>\n<td>Circle\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Bee-waypoint.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/6f/Bee-waypoint.png/40px-Bee-waypoint.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6f/Bee-waypoint.png/60px-Bee-waypoint.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6f/Bee-waypoint.png/80px-Bee-waypoint.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"118\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Bee\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Cave-waypoint.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/90/Cave-waypoint.png/40px-Cave-waypoint.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/90/Cave-waypoint.png/60px-Cave-waypoint.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/90/Cave-waypoint.png/80px-Cave-waypoint.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1280\" data-file-height=\"828\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Cave\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Home-waypoint.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f7/Home-waypoint.png/40px-Home-waypoint.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f7/Home-waypoint.png/60px-Home-waypoint.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f7/Home-waypoint.png/80px-Home-waypoint.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1280\" data-file-height=\"1144\" /></a></span></td>\n<td>Home\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ladder-waypoint.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Ladder-waypoint.png/40px-Ladder-waypoint.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/53/Ladder-waypoint.png/60px-Ladder-waypoint.png 1.5x, /images/t